  "translations": {
    "zh": {
      "Attach checked dataset fingerprints, reference-view details and billing-source context without changing published measurements.": "补充已核对的数据指纹、参考口径和计费来源说明，保留已发布测量值。",
      "Uses the frozen report input manifest SHA-256 ce7895b6f29b754c22d1d51013b89c2b0a8a054a1ef4c6f1580426f916fe7478. The retained result values are the published source-qualified reference view; original-reference statistics are separate.": "采用报告冻结输入清单 SHA-256 ce7895b6f29b754c22d1d51013b89c2b0a8a054a1ef4c6f1580426f916fe7478。保留的结果值采用已发布的来源核验参考口径，原始参考统计单独保留。",
      "The public summary keeps quoted pricing ranges and software-only charges separate from total spend. Missing native model-usage receipts do not mean zero model cost.": "公开摘要分别保留报价范围和软件费用，不把它们当作实际总支出。缺少原生模型用量回执不等于模型费用为零。",
      "Dataset and scorer artifacts are identified by hashes in the public report. Source-qualified annotations and original reference labels must not be mixed within one comparison.": "公开报告用哈希标识数据与评分产物，同一组比较不混用来源核验标注和原始参考。",
      "Null handling uses 6 empty reference fields across 6 pages.": "空值处理使用 6 页中的 6 个空参考字段。",
      "Null handling uses 6 empty reference fields across 6 pages. Case IDs: 0094967f37c647407d92b624202736e3272231cf61f8ccaeca0b19aeb631ab28, 14dc707ee18496c1bcdefc1c99bd76284af686cbb7069ff7c68210ca3094a9f4, 2c036dd02ff3aaeb39dd8b5df19a3c30fbaad448ab8884fb2f8d08b7f2a74066, 4ff590718c188a4d194cc213b07c47b08089c876647ddad17e29b40bfcb635f8, c9f80eb2d0f97dc954bc265169737c1c156b5ec027fbe62994f2018c1e0f67ed, ed28f179058b61273b01adedda587c1446628752bb35c518dc99df225296528c.": "空值处理使用 6 页中的 6 个空参考字段。 页面 ID：0094967f37c647407d92b624202736e3272231cf61f8ccaeca0b19aeb631ab28, 14dc707ee18496c1bcdefc1c99bd76284af686cbb7069ff7c68210ca3094a9f4, 2c036dd02ff3aaeb39dd8b5df19a3c30fbaad448ab8884fb2f8d08b7f2a74066, 4ff590718c188a4d194cc213b07c47b08089c876647ddad17e29b40bfcb635f8, c9f80eb2d0f97dc954bc265169737c1c156b5ec027fbe62994f2018c1e0f67ed, ed28f179058b61273b01adedda587c1446628752bb35c518dc99df225296528c。",
      "All ten methods executed 800 of 800 planned pages and have 800 timing records, with none missing.": "十种方法均完成计划的 800 页调用，各保留 800 条计时记录，无缺失。",
      "Full-page exact match excludes 60 pages with incomplete reference coverage for every method; its denominator is 740, not 800.": "所有方法的整页完全匹配均排除参考覆盖不完整的 60 页，分母为 740 页。",
      "Every method tested 140 of 140 pages, with 140 timing records and no missing timings.": "每种方法均测试全部 140 页，保留 140 条计时记录，无缺失。",
      "Original-reference populations: price 134 nonempty / 6 empty; SKU 135 nonempty / 5 empty; stock 131 in stock / 9 out of stock; out-of-stock detection 9 out of stock / 131 other.": "原始参考分布：价格 134 个非空、6 个空值；SKU 135 个非空、5 个空值；库存 131 个有货、9 个缺货；缺货检测 9 个缺货、131 个其他。",
      "Price ranges and billing conditions are preserved as supplied. Model usage costs for open-source methods were not disclosed; software-only $0 is not a zero total cost.": "保留来源给出的报价区间和计费条件。开源方法未披露模型用量费用，软件费用 $0 不代表总费用为零。",
      "Full-page exact match uses all 140 pages.": "整页完全匹配使用全部 140 页。",
      "Original-reference distribution: 134 nonempty / 6 empty.": "原始参考分布：134 个非空、6 个空值。",
      "Original-reference distribution: 135 nonempty / 5 empty.": "原始参考分布：135 个非空、5 个空值。",
